  "talk.doneStats": ["{n} ta gap aytdingiz, {good} tasi birdaniga toʻgʻri.", "Вы сказали {n} фраз, {good} из них сразу верно.", "You said {n} lines, {good} of them right the first time."],
  "talk.fixes": ["Shularni toʻgʻri aytishni mashq qiling:", "Потренируйтесь говорить это правильно:", "Practise saying these the right way:"],
  "talk.again": ["Yana bir marta", "Ещё раз", "Do it again"],
